                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} 2^\mathbb{N} \cong 2^{\mathbb{N} + \mathbb{N}} \cong 2^\mathbb{N} \times 2^\mathbb{N}
          %p
            and hence a “pairing function”
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi pair
                  %mo :
