                  %mo ≅
                  %mi C
                  %mo ×
                  %mi C
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} pair: C \cong C \times C
            that is a homeomorphism (see
            = succeed ")." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jonsson-Tarski+algebra"} Jonsson-Tarski algebra
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
