                  %mrow
                    %mi a
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} a
              from the right; a similar argument will prove continuity from the left. This is obvious if
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi a
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} a
              is the left endpoint of one of the removed open intervals, again because
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi f
